# A shop window on the street face: a walnut frame under a short teal and
# cream awning, a window box of flowers under the sill, and warm glass so the
# rooms behind it read as lit at night. Two cells wide. Everything outside the
# frame is transparent so the brick face shows through.
sprite street-shop-window
size 32 32
layer wall
footprint 2 1
origin 0 16
tag wall window-front decor
light 16 14 40 #ffd27a 0.6

frame default
